commit 8eb9e60fd95eb4a70a4c442052246964d1dbeb03
Author: s-smits <sjssmits@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Aug 27 11:41:49 2025 +0000

    GRPO/Trainer: synchronize multi-host phases; barrier on step hooks; safer ref-policy sync\n\n- Trainer: add sync_global_devices before/after on_step_start/on_step_end to keep controllers in lockstep.\n- GRPOTrainer.on_step_start: add barriers before ref sync and around alignment check compute to avoid launch-id mismatches.\n- Ref-policy sync: move to step start; support hard/EMA; copy graphother; optional immediate logprob alignment check with tolerance.\n- Mesh: update reference mesh/sharding to match policy.\n- Rollouts: cap rollout_chunk_size to TP to reduce TPU instability under TP>1.\n- Config: add sync_ref_model_on_step_start, ref_model_sync_strategy, ref_sync_copy_graphother, logprob_alignment_check_on_sync, ref_policy_logprob_tolerance; add advantage_norm_mode options.\n- Loss: fix GRPO ratio to use ref_per_token_logps; keep per-token KL.\n- Logprobs: use unified compute_logps for policy and reference.\n

